abstract: >-
  Code and de-identified research data accompanying the study "Saxophone
  register control in a pressure-lip-force control plane: real-time modeling
  and performance measurements." The deposit preserves the original
  experiment runtime, paper-cohort sensor sessions and audio recordings,
  reviewed annotations, analysis pipelines, and the compact validated product
  used for Figure 6.
repository-code: "https://github.com/meguia/register_control_saxophone"
url: "https://github.com/meguia/register_control_saxophone"
keywords:
